Package: omnibuild
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mukesh-craft <mukesh-craft@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/mukesh-craft/omnibuild
Description: local-first build orchestration and artifact verification
 OmniBuild detects a project, plans a build for a target, invokes the
 appropriate toolchain, inspects the result, runs it when possible, and writes
 manifests, hashes, cache entries and release archives.
